# Crib Swap: "Exile target creature. Its controller creates a 1/1 colorless Shapeshifter creature token with changeling." Bot1
# casts it with its three Moxen on Bot2's Ornithopter: the Ornithopter is exiled and Bot2, its controller, gets the 1/1
# Shapeshifter with changeling (the spell is a Kindred instant, itself a changeling, so it goes to Bot1's graveyard).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Crib Swap
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Crib Swap.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Shapeshifter Token
Bot2.Battlefield.Shapeshifter Token.Keywords = Changeling
Bot2.Exile.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Crib Swap
